#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:741
msgctxt "Route110_Text_WeCantTalkAboutAquaActivities"
msgid ""
"TEAM AQUA's activities…\n"
"We can't talk about them yet.$"
msgstr "海洋队的活动……现在还不能说。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:745
msgctxt "Route110_Text_KickUpARuckus"
msgid ""
"I want to get going to SLATEPORT and\n"
"kick up a ruckus!$"
msgstr "我想赶快去凯那市大闹一场！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:749
msgctxt "Route110_Text_MyFirstJobInAqua"
msgid ""
"This is my first job after joining\n"
"TEAM AQUA. It's a little scary.$"
msgstr ""
"这是我加入海洋队后的第一个任务。\n"
"有点害怕呢。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:753
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AquaActionsBringSmiles"
msgid ""
"TEAM AQUA's actions should bring\n"
"smiles to people's faces!$"
msgstr "海洋队的行动应该给人们带来笑容才对！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:757
msgctxt "Route110_Text_MayLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}, long time no see!\p"
"While I was searching for other\n"
"POKéMON, my POKéMON grew stronger.\p"
"So…\n"
"How about a little battle?$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}，好久不见！\p"
"在我寻找其他宝可梦的时候，\n"
"我的宝可梦也变强了。\p"
"所以……我们来稍微对战一下怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:764
msgctxt "Route110_Text_MayDefeated"
msgid ""
"Yikes!\n"
"You're better than I expected!$"
msgstr "哎呀！你比我想象的还要厉害！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:768
msgctxt "Route110_Text_MayTakeThis"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, you've been busy\n"
"training, too, haven't you?\p"
"I think you deserve a reward!\n"
"This is from me!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
"你也一直在忙着修行吧？\p"
"我觉得你应该得到奖励！这是我送你的！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:774
msgctxt "Route110_Text_MayExplainItemfinder"
msgid ""
"MAY: That's an ITEMFINDER.\p"
"Try it out. If there is an item that's\n"
"not visible, it emits a sound.\p"
"Okay, {PLAYER}{KUN}, let's meet again!\p"
"I know it's a little silly coming from\n"
"me, but I think you should train a lot\l"
"harder for the next time.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：那是探宝器。\p"
"试试看吧。如果附近有看不见的道具，\n"
"它就会发出声音。\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}{KUN}，我们下次再见吧！\p"
"虽然由我来说有点奇怪，但我觉得你\n"
"下次之前应该更加努力地修行才行。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:783
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BrendanLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}.\n"
"So this is where you were.\l"
"How's it going?\p"
"Have you been raising your POKéMON?\n"
"I'll check for you.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：嘿，{PLAYER}。\n"
"原来你在这里啊。最近怎么样？\p"
"你有好好培养宝可梦吗？\n"
"我来帮你检验一下。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:790
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BrendanDefeated"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"You're pretty good.$"
msgstr "嗯……你相当厉害嘛。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:794
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BrendanTakeThis"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}, you've trained\n"
"without me noticing…\p"
"Good enough!\n"
"Here, take this.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：{PLAYER}，\n"
"你在我没注意的时候变强了啊……\p"
"还不错嘛！给，拿着这个。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:800
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BrendanExplainItemfinder"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: That's an ITEMFINDER.\p"
"Use it to root around for items that\n"
"aren't visible.\p"
"If it senses something, it emits\n"
"a sound.\p"
"Anyway, I'm off to look for new\n"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：那是探宝器。\p"
"用它可以找到看不见的道具。\p"
"如果感应到了什么，它就会发出声音。\p"
"总之，我要去找新的宝可梦了。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:809
msgctxt "Route110_Text_RideBikeAtFullSpeed"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't it be great to ride a BIKE\n"
"at full speed on CYCLING ROAD?$"
msgstr ""
"要是能在自行车道上全速骑自行车，\n"
"那该多棒啊！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:813
msgctxt "Route110_Text_HairStreamsBehindMe"
msgid ""
"How do you like the way my raven-\n"
"colored hair streams behind me?\p"
"I grew my hair out just for that.$"
msgstr ""
"我这一头乌黑的秀发在身后飘扬的样子，\n"
"你觉得怎么样？\p"
"我就是为了这个才把头发留长的。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:818
msgctxt "Route110_Text_YouGotBikeFromRydel"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey, you got that BIKE from RYDEL!\p"
"Oh, it's glaringly obvious.\n"
"It says right on your bike…\p"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\n"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\p"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\n"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\p"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\n"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\p"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\n"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\p"
"RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL…\n"
"That name's everywhere.\p"
"You should ride it around all over\n"
"the place--it's good advertising!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，嘿，你那辆自行车是\n"
"从风野那里拿到的吧！\p"
"哦，一眼就能看出来。\n"
"你的自行车上写得清清楚楚……\p"
"风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、\n"
"风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、\l"
"风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、\l"
"风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、风野、\l"
"风野、风野、风野……这名字到处都是。\p"
"你应该骑着它到处跑——这可是\n"
"很好的广告！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:835
msgctxt "Route110_Text_TwoRoads"
msgid ""
"The two roads, one above, one below…\p"
"A road each for people and POKéMON.\n"
"Perhaps that is right and fair.$"
msgstr ""
"两条路，一条在上，一条在下……\p"
"一条给人走，一条给宝可梦走。\n"
"这样也许才算公平合理吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:840
msgctxt "Route110_Text_WalkOnTheLowRoad"
msgid ""
"I don't have a BIKE, so I'll take\n"
"a leisurely walk on the low road.$"
msgstr ""
"我没有自行车，\n"
"所以我要在下面的路上悠闲地散步。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:844
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BikeTechniques"
msgid ""
"Learning techniques will make BIKE\n"
"riding even more fun.\p"
"There are some places that you can\n"
"reach only by using a BIKE technique.$"
msgstr ""
"学会一些技巧，\n"
"骑自行车会变得更加有趣。\p"
"有些地方只有用自行车技巧才能到达。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:850
msgctxt "Route110_Text_WhichShouldIChoose"
msgid ""
"Which should I choose?\p"
"Make a beeline for MAUVILLE on\n"
"CYCLING ROAD, or take the low road\l"
"and look for POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"我该选哪条路呢？\p"
"是走自行车道直奔紫堇市，\n"
"还是走下面的路去找宝可梦呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:856
msgctxt "Route110_Text_CyclingChallengeResultSummary"
msgid ""
"Number of collisions:\n"
"… … {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Total time:\n"
"… … {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""
"碰撞次数：…… ……{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"总用时：…… ……{STR_VAR_2}！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:862
msgctxt "Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionBest"
msgid ""
"Bravo! Splendid showing!\p"
"Your love of cycling comes from deep\n"
"within your heart.\l"
"You've shaken me to my very soul!$"
msgstr ""
"太精彩了！表现得非常出色！\p"
"你对骑车的热爱发自内心深处。\n"
"你让我的灵魂都为之震撼！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:868
msgctxt "Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionGood"
msgid ""
"Your technique is remarkable.\p"
"I suggest you speed up a bit while\n"
"still avoiding collisions.$"
msgstr ""
"你的技术很了不起。\p"
"我建议你在避免碰撞的同时，\n"
"再稍微加快一点速度。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:873
msgctxt "Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionOk"
msgid ""
"I would consider you a work in\n"
"progress.\p"
"Still, I hope you don't forget the\n"
"sheer pleasure of cycling.$"
msgstr ""
"我觉得你还在进步当中。\p"
"不过，希望你不要忘记骑车的纯粹乐趣。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:879
msgctxt "Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionBad"
msgid ""
"My word… Your cycling skills border\n"
"on terrifying.\p"
"Most certainly, you need much more\n"
"practice riding.$"
msgstr ""
"天哪……\n"
"你的骑车技术简直到了可怕的程度。\p"
"你绝对需要多加练习才行。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:885
msgctxt "Route110_Text_ChallengeReactionWorst"
msgid ""
"…I am aghast…\p"
"You're perhaps not cut out for this\n"
"unfortunate cycling business.\p"
"You ought to give serious thought to\n"
"returning that BIKE to RYDEL.$"
msgstr ""
"……我惊呆了……\p"
"你也许不适合骑车这件不幸的事。\p"
"你应该认真考虑一下把自行车还给风野。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:892
msgctxt "Route110_Text_RatedForNumberOfCollisions"
msgid ""
"This is CYCLING ROAD.\p"
"If you were to ride from MAUVILLE to\n"
"SLATEPORT on a MACH BIKE, you would\l"
"be rated for the number of collisions\l"
"and your total time.$"
msgstr ""
"这里是自行车道。\p"
"如果骑着音速自行车从紫堇市骑到凯那\n"
"市，就会根据碰撞次数和总用时来评分。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:899
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AlwaysAimHigher"
msgid ""
"Regardless of the results, I count on\n"
"seeing more challenges from you.\l"
"Always aim higher!$"
msgstr ""
"不管结果如何，我都期待你继续挑战。\n"
"永远要追求更高的目标！$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:904
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AcroBikesDoNotQualify"
msgid ""
"On this CYCLING ROAD, those riding\n"
"MACH BIKES are rated for their number\l"
"of collisions and their total times.\p"
"ACRO BIKES do not qualify for rating.\n"
"They are easy to turn, so it's not fair.$"
msgstr ""
"在这条自行车道上，骑音速自行车的\n"
"人会根据碰撞次数和总用时来评分。\p"
"越野自行车不在评分范围内。\n"
"因为它转弯太容易，这样不公平。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:911
msgctxt "Route110_Text_SlateportCitySign"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 110\n"
"{DOWN_ARROW} SLATEPORT CITY$"
msgstr ""
"110号道路\n"
"{DOWN_ARROW} 凯那市$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:915
msgctxt "Route110_Text_CyclingRoadSign"
msgid "SEASIDE CYCLING ROAD$"
msgstr "海边自行车道$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:918
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AquaWasHere"
msgid ""
"“TEAM AQUA was here!”\p"
"Someone painted that onto this sign,\n"
"but then someone else painted over it.\p"
"“TEAM MAGMA rules!” is what it\n"
"says now.$"
msgstr ""
"“海洋队到此一游！”\p"
"有人在这块告示牌上写了这句话，\n"
"但后来又被别人涂掉了。\p"
"现在上面写的是“熔岩队最棒！”$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:925
msgctxt "Route110_Text_Route103Sign"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 110\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 103$"
msgstr ""
"110号道路\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} 103号道路$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:929
msgctxt "Route110_Text_SeasideParkingSign"
msgid "SEASIDE PARKING$"
msgstr "海边停车场$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:932
msgctxt "Route110_Text_MauvilleCitySign"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 110\n"
"{UP_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY$"
msgstr ""
"110号道路\n"
"{UP_ARROW} 紫堇市$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:936
msgctxt "Route110_Text_TrainerTipsPrlzSleep"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"The foe can be made helpless by\n"
"paralyzing it or causing it to sleep.\p"
"It is an important technique for\n"
"POKéMON battles.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小知识\p"
"让对手陷入麻痹或睡眠状态，\n"
"就能让它无法动弹。\p"
"这是宝可梦对战中的一项重要技巧。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:943
msgctxt "Route110_Text_TrainerTipsRegisterItems"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"The items in the BAG can be reorganized\n"
"by pressing SELECT.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小知识\p"
"按SELECT键可以整理包包里的道具。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:948
msgctxt "Route110_Text_TrickHouseSign"
msgid ""
"“Three steps {RIGHT_ARROW} and two steps {UP_ARROW}\n"
"to reach the wondrous TRICK HOUSE.”$"
msgstr ""
"“向{RIGHT_ARROW}走3步，向{UP_ARROW}走2步，\n"
"就能到达奇妙的机关屋。”$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:952
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BestRecord"
msgid ""
"THE BEST RECORD TO DATE…\p"
"No. of collisions: {STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Elapsed time: {STR_VAR_2}$"
msgstr ""
"迄今为止的最佳纪录……\p"
"碰撞次数：{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"用时：{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:957
msgctxt "Route110_Text_ThereIsNoRecord"
msgid ""
"THE BEST RECORD TO DATE…\p"
"No one seems to have taken the\n"
"challenge. There is no record…$"
msgstr ""
"迄今为止的最佳纪录……\p"
"好像还没有人挑战过。没有纪录……$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:962
msgctxt "Route110_Text_ImagineSeeingYouHere"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Imagine seeing you here!\p"
"And where might my {RIVAL} be?$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：哦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"没想到会在这里遇见你！\p"
"我家{RIVAL}在哪里呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:967
msgctxt "Route110_Text_HeardYouInstallMatchCall"
msgid ""
"Oh, I see!\n"
"You two are running separately.\l"
"Well, that's fine.\p"
"Oh, yes, I heard that your POKéNAV\n"
"had the MATCH CALL system installed.\p"
"Well, then, I should register you in\n"
"my POKéNAV as well.\p"
"That way, even when we're apart,\n"
"I can rate your POKéDEX anytime.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""
"哦，原来如此！你们两个是\n"
"分头行动的啊。嗯，那也不错。\p"
"哦，对了，听说你的\n"
"宝可梦导航装了对战呼叫系统。\p"
"那么，我也应该把\n"
"你登记到我的宝可梦导航里。\p"
"这样一来，即使我们不在一起，\n"
"我也能随时评价你的宝可梦图鉴。\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:979
msgctxt "Route110_Text_RegisteredBirchInPokenav"
msgid ""
"Registered PROF. BIRCH\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr "在宝可梦导航里登记了小田卷博士。$"

#: data/maps/Route110/scripts.inc:983
msgctxt "Route110_Text_KeepAnEyeOutForRival"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"Please keep an eye out for my {RIVAL}.\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Well, I had better get going.\n"
"See you again, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：{PLAYER}{KUN}……\p"
"请帮我多关照一下我家{RIVAL}。……\n"
" …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"好了，我也该走了。再见啦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！$"
